---
const safeguards = [
  { label: '内容 hash', title: '压过的图片不再压第二次', text: '缓存记录最终文件内容。新增或改动的图片继续处理，未变化的文件直接跳过。' },
  { label: '变大回退', title: '候选图没有更小，就保留原图', text: '小 icon 本来就很紧，强行量化可能变大。结果必须比原图小，才允许覆盖。' },
  { label: '硬门禁', title: '解码、尺寸和 alpha 先过关', text: '候选图打不开、宽高变化、透明通道丢失或动画帧数变化，立即回退。' },
  { label: '质量门禁', title: '白底黑底都看，避免透明图漏判', text: 'PSNR、SSIM、MAE 和 alpha MAE 同时检查，只拦明显坏图，不替代最终肉眼验收。' },
  { label: '动图保护', title: 'APNG 不进入有损量化', text: '检测到 acTL 动画块直接跳过，避免一张动图被压成静态首帧。' },
  { label: '并行执行', title: '几万张资源可以持续跑', text: '目录递归和多进程并行补上网页工具缺少的批处理能力。' },
];
---

<div class="png-showcase" data-png-showcase>
  <section id="story" class="showcase-section origin-section wide">
    <div class="section-label">01 · 从一个在线工具的边界开始</div>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 class="display">几张图可以上传，<br />整个工程不能靠手点。</h2>
      <p>
        包体积治理需要一次处理几万张 PNG，后面还会不断新增资源。
        在线工具效果不错，但上传、额度、隐私和重复执行都会进入主链路。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="constraint-line">
      <div><span>素材规模</span><strong>一次覆盖整个资源目录</strong></div>
      <i></i>
      <div><span>持续增量</span><strong>今天压完，明天还有新图</strong></div>
      <i></i>
      <div><span>本地边界</span><strong>项目图片不需要离开机器</strong></div>
      <i></i>
      <div class="target"><span>真正目标</span><strong>一条能反复跑的工程流水线</strong></div>
    </div>

    <div class="build-story">
      <div>
        <span>起点</span>
        <strong>TinyPNG 的效果值得研究</strong>
        <p>先查它公开讲了什么，再找同类开源实现和可复用参数。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>几个小时后</span>
        <strong>AI 把研究结果落成了 Skill</strong>
        <p>组合工具、补脚本、加缓存、写回退，再用测试和真实素材验证。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>边界</span>
        <strong>没有复刻 TinyPNG 的未公开算法</strong>
        <p>它采用同类公开技术路线，并补齐了工程里真正缺失的部分。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="showcase-band">
    <div class="wide">
      <div class="section-label">02 · 拆开公开原理</div>
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 class="display">省大头的是颜色，<br />省小头的是编码。</h2>
        <p>
          TinyPNG 公开说明会合并相近颜色、转成更小的索引色，并清理元数据。
          `pngquant` 作者也把 TinyPNG 等服务列为同类量化方案的应用。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="algorithm-flow">
        <div class="flow-source">
          <span>INPUT</span>
          <strong>24 / 32 bit PNG</strong>
          <p>真彩色、透明通道、原始编码和元数据。</p>
        </div>
        <i></i>
        <div class="flow-main">
          <span>pngquant</span>
          <strong>24 / 32 bit → 8 bit 调色板</strong>
          <p>改进的颜色量化、感知权重、自适应抖动和 alpha / gamma 处理。</p>
          <b>有损 · 主要收益</b>
        </div>
        <i></i>
        <div class="flow-tail">
          <span>oxipng</span>
          <strong>filter + DEFLATE + strip</strong>
          <p>重新选择滤波方式、重压编码并清理非必要元数据。</p>
          <b>无损 · 继续收紧</b>
        </div>
        <i></i>
        <div class="flow-output">
          <span>OUTPUT</span>
          <strong>候选 PNG</strong>
          <p>先过门禁，再决定覆盖还是回退。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="evidence-note">
        <span>公开证据</span>
        <p>
          公开对比表明，默认参数下 TinyPNG 往往更小；调整 `pngquant` 的质量参数后，
          本地方案可以追平或反超测试集。素材、参数和验证方式共同决定结果。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="compression-lab" class="showcase-section lab-section wide">
    <div class="section-label">03 · 同一条流水线，不同素材走不同判断</div>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 class="display">每张图片都要单独决定，<br />覆盖还是回退。</h2>
      <p>
        切换下面四类素材，可以看到参数、门禁和最终动作怎样变化。
        Skill 既要压得小，也要知道什么时候应该停手。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="compression-lab">
      <div class="mode-list" role="tablist" aria-label="PNG 素材类型">
        <button class="active" type="button" role="tab" data-compress-mode="normal" aria-selected="true">
          <span>01</span><strong>普通图片</strong><small>标准量化</small>
        </button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" data-compress-mode="small" aria-selected="false">
          <span>02</span><strong>小图 / Icon</strong><small>提高质量下限</small>
        </button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" data-compress-mode="alpha" aria-selected="false">
          <span>03</span><strong>透明 PNG</strong><small>双底色质量检查</small>
        </button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" data-compress-mode="apng" aria-selected="false">
          <span>04</span><strong>APNG</strong><small>检测后直接跳过</small>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="lab-content">
        <div class="lab-copy">
          <span data-lab-eyebrow>STANDARD PNG</span>
          <h3 data-lab-title>量化颜色，再做无损收尾</h3>
          <p data-lab-description>普通图使用 65-85 质量区间，主要体积由 pngquant 降下来。</p>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>参数</dt><dd data-lab-policy>quality 65-85 · speed 1 · dithering 1.0</dd></div>
            <div><dt>门禁</dt><dd data-lab-gates>解码 · 尺寸 · alpha · PSNR / SSIM / MAE · 更小</dd></div>
            <div><dt>动作</dt><dd data-lab-action>通过后原地覆盖，最终 hash 写入缓存</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="lab-visual">
          <div class="lab-file">
            <div class="lab-scene">
              <i></i><b></b><em></em>
            </div>
          <span data-lab-file>hero-3x.png</span>
          </div>
          <div class="lab-route">
            <span data-route-step="0">pngquant</span>
            <i></i>
            <span data-route-step="1">oxipng</span>
            <i></i>
            <span data-route-step="2">quality gates</span>
          </div>
          <div class="lab-verdict pass" data-lab-verdict>
            <span>PASS</span>
            <strong data-lab-result>候选图更小且质量门禁通过</strong>
            <p data-lab-detail>覆盖原图，缓存最终文件内容。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="showcase-band safety-section">
    <div class="wide">
      <div class="section-label">04 · 两个工具之外，才是工程能力</div>
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 class="display">压缩算法公开，<br />可靠地反复运行并不天然成立。</h2>
        <p>
          工程化首先要补齐边界：哪些目录不能碰，哪些图片不能压，
          哪些结果不能覆盖，以及下一次怎么只处理新增和变化。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="safeguard-grid">
        {safeguards.map((item) => (
          <article>
            <span>{item.label}</span>
            <h3>{item.title}</h3>
            <p>{item.text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="showcase-section proof-section wide">
    <div class="section-label">05 · 一次公开可复现的现场验证</div>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 class="display">先拿自己的公开素材跑，<br />再谈“效果怎么样”。</h2>
      <p>
        下面是本网站公开目录的一次 `--dry-run`。它只证明这条流水线在这批素材上的真实输出，
        不代表所有项目都能得到同样比例。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="proof-run">
      <div class="proof-command">
        <span>DRY RUN · PUBLIC CORPUS</span>
        <code>./compress.sh public --dry-run -j 4</code>
        <p>运行前后对 23 张原图做 SHA-256 对照，确认 dry-run 没有改动任何文件。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-metrics">
        <div><span>PNG</span><strong>23</strong><small>张公开素材</small></div>
        <div><span>BEFORE</span><strong>30.1</strong><small>MB</small></div>
        <div><span>AFTER</span><strong>8.1</strong><small>MB 候选结果</small></div>
        <div class="accent"><span>SAVED</span><strong>73.0%</strong><small>本批素材</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-gates">
        <span><i></i>23 张进入压缩</span>
        <span><i></i>0 张硬门禁回退</span>
        <span><i></i>0 张质量门禁回退</span>
        <span><i></i>0 个失败</span>
        <span><i></i>原图 hash 全部不变</span>
        <span><i></i>耗时 23.0 秒</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="proof-conclusion">
      <span>这个案例真正说明什么</span>
      <strong>AI 没有重新发明压缩算法。它把公开知识快速查明、组合、调参，再补成一条有缓存、有门禁、有回退的工程链路。</strong>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
  const initPngShowcase = () => {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-png-showcase]').forEach((root) => {
      if (root.dataset.ready === 'true') return;
      root.dataset.ready = 'true';

      const buttons = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-compress-mode]'));
      const eyebrow = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-eyebrow]');
      const title = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-title]');
      const description = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-description]');
      const policy = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-policy]');
      const gates = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-gates]');
      const action = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-action]');
      const file = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-file]');
      const verdict = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-verdict]');
      const result = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-result]');
      const detail = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-lab-detail]');
      const routeSteps = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-route-step]'));
      const configs = {
        normal: {
          eyebrow: 'STANDARD PNG',
          title: '量化颜色，再做无损收尾',
          description: '普通图使用 65-85 质量区间，主要体积由 pngquant 降下来。',
          policy: 'quality 65-85 · speed 1 · dithering 1.0',
          gates: '解码 · 尺寸 · alpha · PSNR / SSIM / MAE · 更小',
          action: '通过后原地覆盖，最终 hash 写入缓存',
          file: 'hero-3x.png',
          verdict: 'pass',
          badge: 'PASS',
          result: '候选图更小且质量门禁通过',
          detail: '覆盖原图，缓存最终文件内容。',
          activeRoute: 2,
        },
        small: {
          eyebrow: 'SMALL IMAGE',
          title: '小图提高质量下限',
          description: '20KB 以下的 icon 改用更保守的 70-90 区间，减少边缘和细节发糊。',
          policy: 'size < 20KB · quality 70-90',
          gates: '同样经过解码、alpha 与质量检查',
          action: '压完没有更小就保留原图，不强求收益',
          file: 'icon.png',
          verdict: 'keep',
          badge: 'KEEP',
          result: '候选图没有更小',
          detail: '保留原图，并缓存当前 hash，后续不再重复尝试。',
          activeRoute: 2,
        },
        alpha: {
          eyebrow: 'ALPHA PNG',
          title: '透明图要在两种底色上检查',
          description: '只比较透明像素会漏掉边缘问题，因此分别垫白底和黑底计算质量指标。',
          policy: 'white / black composite · alpha MAE ≤ 3',
          gates: 'alpha 存在 · alpha MAE · 两组 PSNR / SSIM / MAE',
          action: '透明边缘或颜色误差过大时自动回退',
          file: 'overlay.png',
          verdict: 'pass',
          badge: 'PASS',
          result: '透明通道和双底色质量检查通过',
          detail: '候选图可以覆盖；正式交付仍抽检阴影和毛玻璃。',
          activeRoute: 2,
        },
        apng: {
          eyebrow: 'ANIMATED PNG',
          title: '发现动画，整条有损链路跳过',
          description: '脚本读取 PNG 的 acTL 块识别 APNG，避免量化工具只保留静态首帧。',
          policy: 'frame_count > 1 · skip',
          gates: '只完成格式与动画帧检测',
          action: '保留原图并写入缓存',
          file: 'spinner.png',
          verdict: 'skip',
          badge: 'SKIP',
          result: '检测到 APNG',
          detail: '不调用 pngquant 和 oxipng，动画原样保留。',
          activeRoute: -1,
        },
      };

      const render = (mode: keyof typeof configs) => {
        const config = configs[mode];
        buttons.forEach((button) => {
          const active = button.dataset.compressMode === mode;
          button.classList.toggle('active', active);
          button.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));
        });
        if (eyebrow) eyebrow.textContent = config.eyebrow;
        if (title) title.textContent = config.title;
        if (description) description.textContent = config.description;
        if (policy) policy.textContent = config.policy;
        if (gates) gates.textContent = config.gates;
        if (action) action.textContent = config.action;
        if (file) file.textContent = config.file;
        if (result) result.textContent = config.result;
        if (detail) detail.textContent = config.detail;
        if (verdict) {
          verdict.className = `lab-verdict ${config.verdict}`;
          const badge = verdict.querySelector<HTMLElement>('span');
          if (badge) badge.textContent = config.badge;
        }
        routeSteps.forEach((step, index) => {
          step.classList.toggle('active', config.activeRoute >= index);
          step.classList.toggle('disabled', config.activeRoute < 0);
        });
      };

      buttons.forEach((button) => {
        button.addEventListener('click', () => {
          render((button.dataset.compressMode ?? 'normal') as keyof typeof configs);
        });
      });
      render('normal');
    });
  };

  initPngShowcase();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initPngShowcase);
</script>

<style>
  .png-showcase {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .showcase-section,
  .showcase-band > .wide {
    padding-block: 102px;
  }

  .showcase-band {
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.012);
  }

  .section-heading {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 32px;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(300px, 0.64fr);
    align-items: end;
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 52px;
    line-height: 1.18;
  }

  .section-heading p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .constraint-line {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 66px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 38px 1fr 38px 1fr 38px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .constraint-line > div {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 138px;
    padding: 22px 20px;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .constraint-line > div:first-child {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .constraint-line > div.target {
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.38);
    background: rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.035);
  }

  .constraint-line span,
  .build-story span,
  .flow-source > span,
  .flow-main > span,
  .flow-tail > span,
  .flow-output > span,
  .evidence-note > span,
  .safeguard-grid article > span,
  .proof-command > span,
  .proof-conclusion > span {
    color: var(--accent);
    font: 10px var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .constraint-line strong {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .constraint-line > i,
  .algorithm-flow > i {
    position: relative;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.3);
  }

  .constraint-line > i::after,
  .algorithm-flow > i::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: -3px;
    right: 1px;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--accent);
    content: "";
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .build-story {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 38px;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .build-story > div {
    min-height: 190px;
    padding: 26px 28px 26px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .build-story > div + div {
    padding-left: 28px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .build-story strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .build-story p,
  .algorithm-flow p,
  .safeguard-grid p,
  .proof-command p {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.78;
  }

  .algorithm-flow {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 68px;
    grid-template-columns: 0.7fr 32px 1.25fr 32px 1.12fr 32px 0.7fr;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .algorithm-flow > div {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 230px;
    padding: 26px;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 13px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #050505;
  }

  .algorithm-flow > div:first-child {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .algorithm-flow > div:last-child {
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .algorithm-flow strong {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .algorithm-flow b {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font: 9px var(--mono);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .flow-main {
    border-color: rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.38) !important;
    background: rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.035) !important;
  }

  .evidence-note {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 38px;
    padding-block: 22px;
    grid-template-columns: 110px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 26px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .evidence-note p {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .compression-lab {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 66px;
    grid-template-columns: 260px minmax(0, 1fr);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #050505;
  }

  .mode-list {
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .mode-list button {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 92px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    align-content: center;
    border: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .mode-list button:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .mode-list button::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    bottom: 16px;
    left: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: transparent;
    content: "";
  }

  .mode-list button > span {
    grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font: 9px var(--mono);
  }

  .mode-list button > strong {
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .mode-list button > small {
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .mode-list button.active {
    background: rgba(245, 185, 113, 0.04);
